                            "settings": {
                                "html": "<div class='timeline-wrap'>\n  <h3 class='timeline-header'>Our Journey</h3>\n  <div class='timeline-list'>\n    <div class='timeline-item'>\n      <div class='time-year'>Why</div>\n      <div class='time-content'>\n        <h4>Most of what we carry started young.</h4>\n        <p>In working with adults, a pattern became clear. Most of the pain people are processing in their 30s and 40s has roots in childhood &mdash; in things they were never given language for.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='timeline-item'>\n      <div class='time-year'>Decks</div>\n      <div class='time-content'>\n        <h4>Affirmation Decks</h4>\n        <p>Simple, visual affirmations designed for children aged 4&ndash;12. Beautiful, gentle, and genuinely fun to use &mdash; alone or with a parent.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='timeline-item'>\n      <div class='time-year'>Talks</div>\n      <div class='time-content'>\n        <h4>Conversation Decks</h4>\n        <p>Cards that open real conversations between kids and the adults who love them. About feelings, fears, and what it means to be okay.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='timeline-item last'>\n      <div class='time-year'>Reason</div>\n      <div class='time-content'>\n        <h4>Why we built them</h4>\n        <p>Not as a product line. As a response to what we kept seeing in our adult sessions. Every card is built with intention &mdash; and with the child's inner world in mind.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.timeline-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.timeline-header {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 36px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 0 64px !important;\n}\n.timeline-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n.timeline-item {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 48px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .timeline-item { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }\n}\n.time-year {\n    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n    font-size: 36px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    color: #688F9D !important;\n    width: 128px !important;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n.time-content {\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    padding-bottom: 48px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.1) !important;\n    margin-bottom: 48px;\n}\n.timeline-item.last .time-content {\n    border-bottom: none !important;\n}\n.time-content h4 {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 20px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    color: #1D3152 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em !important;\n    margin: 0 0 12px !important;\n}\n.time-content p {\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    font-weight: 300 !important;\n    line-height: 1.625 !important;\n    color: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.6) !important;\n    margin: 0;\n    max-width: 42rem !important;\n}\n</style>"
